<title>UK: Credit Suisse sets 200 mln SFR 7-yr bond. [CORRECTED 09:15 GMT]</title>
<headline>Credit Suisse sets 200 mln SFR 7-yr bond. [CORRECTED 09:15 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Credit Suisse First Boston.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CREDIT SUISSE</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN SFR   COUPON     4.0	 MATURITY    31.JUL.09</p>
<p>(Corrects maturity from 31.JUL.04).</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    31.JUL.97</p>
<p> LISTING    EBS</p>
<p> MOODY	A1	  DENOMS (K) FIVE	SALE LIMITS US</p>
<p> GOV LAW    SWISS						  =</p>
<p> NOTES	SUBORDINATED.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
